- Experience in biodiversity, conservation, ecosystems, and environment related areas is an asset;

- Experience in communication and visibility-related activities is an asset; familiarity with social media platforms, websites or digital media channels is an asset.

- Experience with research, data analysis, report writing or project support is an asset;

